# Third-party licence texts ship byte-exact.
#
# The pre-push guard runs `git diff --check`, which refuses trailing
# whitespace. These files are the SIL Open Font License and the IBM Plex
# licence as their authors wrote them, and they travel with the font files they
# cover. Reformatting somebody else's licence to satisfy our own lint is the
# wrong trade, so the check is turned off for them rather than the text edited.
apps/openagents-mobile/assets/fonts/OFL.txt -whitespace
apps/openagents-mobile/assets/fonts/license.txt -whitespace
